title: Knowledge Base
# Pattern: virtual sub-sections.
# The files on disk are flat (no sub-folders), but .pages can group them
# into themed sub-sections in the sidebar. Each sub-section becomes a
# collapsible group — the grouping lives only in this file, not in the
# filesystem.
nav:
  - index.md
  - Group A:
    - "Example Topic One": example-topic.md
  # - Group B:
  #   - "Another topic": another-topic.md
